{"kind":"table","sheet":"Test Scenario","address":"A1:G72","rows":72,"cols":7,"values":[["No","Test Scenario","Test Step","Expected Result","Actual Result","Status (Pass/Fail)","Remark"],["1","HR Connect - Login & Landing","1. Login sebagai user HR Connect\n2. Buka dashboard HERO\n3. Verifikasi sidebar dan landing page","User berhasil masuk, landing page tampil, dan menu HR Connect terlihat sesuai role.","MEET","PASS",null],["2","HR Connect - Menu Scope Validation","1. Cek sidebar Human Capital\n2. Cek Command Center\n3. Cek area Hero Point","Menu yang diuji: Human Capital selain Recruitment/Training/LMS, Command Center, Hero Point.","MEET","PASS",null],["3","HR Connect - Excluded Module Validation","1. Cari Recruitment\n2. Cari Online Tests\n3. Cari Training Enhancement/Training Records/LMS\n4. Cari HSE","Recruitment, Online Tests, Training Enhancement, Training Records, LMS/SSO, dan HSE tidak menjadi test utama HR Connect.","MEET","PASS",null],["4","HR Connect - RBAC Read Access","1. Login user viewer\n2. Buka semua menu HR Connect\n3. Cek tombol create/edit/delete","Viewer hanya bisa membaca data. Tombol aksi terbatas sesuai permission.","MEET","PASS",null],["5","HR Connect - RBAC Admin Access","1. Login admin HR\n2. Buka semua menu HR Connect\n3. Cek aksi create/edit/delete/import/export","Admin HR melihat aksi operasional sesuai permission tanpa akses modul excluded.","MEET","PASS",null],["6","Curhat HR - Submit Case","1. Buka Curhat Dengan HR\n2. Isi subject, kategori, pesan\n3. Submit","Case baru tersimpan dengan status awal dan pesan pertama tampil.","MEET","PASS",null],["7","Curhat HR - Upload Attachment","1. Buka case Curhat HR\n2. Upload lampiran valid\n3. Simpan/kirim pesan","Lampiran tersimpan, nama file terlihat, dan dapat dibuka sesuai akses.","MEET","PASS",null]],"valuesTruncated":true,"valuesPreviewRows":8,"valuesPreviewCols":7,"valuesPreviewAddress":"A1:G8"}
